### Listar conversas do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/api/conversations?page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Buscar conversa por ID
GET {{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Listar mensagens de uma conversa
GET {{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages?page=1&per_page=50
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Enviar mensagem
POST {{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "conteudo": "Olá, como posso ajudá-lo?",
  "tipo": "text"
}

### Buscar conversas (por nome ou telefone)
GET {{base_url}}/api/conversations?search=joao&page=1&per_page=20
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Assumir conversa manualmente (humano substitui IA)
POST {{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/takeover
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}

### Devolver conversa ao especialista
POST {{base_url}}/api/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/release
Authorization: Bearer {{tenant_token}}
